<p>Send out a claw of fire, striking in a line doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">17, 23, 27, 31, 34</acronym> damage leading to a target. The target is caught in the claw's grasp, taking <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">98%, 112%, 122%, 131%, 139%</acronym> weapon damage as fire damage and becoming unable to move for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 4, 4, 4</acronym> turns, while also taking <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">17, 23, 27, 31, 34</acronym> damage per turn.</p><p>Starting from talent level 4, it will also silence.</p><p>The beam damage and damage over time will increase with your Spellpower.</p>